━━━ stdout
Write opentide MCP configuration for editors and agents.

Usage: opentide setup mcp [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -C, --path <PATH_FLAG>
          Repository path
          
          [default: .]

      --vscode
          Configure VS Code (.vscode/mcp.json)

      --cursor
          Configure Cursor (.cursor/mcp.json)

      --claude-code
          Configure Claude Code (.mcp.json)

      --generic
          Configure any MCP host (opentide.mcp.json)

      --plan
          List the files each step would write, and write nothing

  -y, --yes
          Write without asking for confirmation

      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide setup mcp --vscode --yes

━━━ stderr · empty
